      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "• Host server — On a host server system, MDSM and the storage array communicate management requests and event information using in-band or out-of band-connections.\n• Management station — On a management station, MDSM communicates with the storage array either through an Ethernet connection to the storage array management port or through an Ethernet connection to a host server.",
