      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Connecting The Storage Array\n• 12 gpbs SAS Host Ports (2) — Allows you to connect host servers to the storage array.\n• 1 gbps Ethernet Management (MGMT) Port (1) — Management port allows for out of band management of storage array.\n• Reserved Ethernet Port (1) — Reserved.\n• SAS Expansion Ports (2) — Allows you to connect the storage array to optional PowerVault MD1200 series expansion enclosures for additional storage capacity.",
